{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/A_Quiet_Place_in_the_Sand.png?t=1751507643\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Dustoria</strong>, you begin with a few structures and a wide, open desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No enemies. No timers. Just soft winds, golden light, and the slow joy of building something from nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You choose how your settlement takes shape, there's no rush.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/Build_with_Purpose.png?t=1751507643\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each building gives points based on where and how you place it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your water collector near moisture, solar panels in open areas, farms close to homes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s part strategy, part creativity, like a puzzle you build at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/extras/The_World_Grows_With_You.png?t=1751507643\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every time you level up, you gain a new piece of land. These extra tiles are procedurally generated and can be placed wherever you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to expand near your water collectors? Or leave space for future buildings? It's up to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742110?t=1751507643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3742110?t=1751507643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742110/4319